@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontColor #111111
title FiscalWave - proposed system map / mapa propuesto
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
actor "Operator / Operador" as Operator
cloud "OIDC Provider" as OIDC
cloud "Chilean SII (external)" as SII
rectangle "Frontend Shell (React + TS)" as Shell {
  component "Invoices MFE" as Invoices
  component "Partners MFE" as Partners
  component "Operations MFE" as Operations
  component "Admin MFE" as Admin
}
rectangle "Ingress / API BFF" as API
package "FiscalWave services (target)" {
  component "Tenant Service" as Tenant
  component "Catalog Service" as Catalog
  component "Fiscal Document Service\n(sole folio owner)" as Fiscal
  component "Chile SII Connector" as Connector
  component "Notifications" as Notify
  component "Reporting" as Reporting
}
database "PostgreSQL\nper-service data ownership" as DB
queue "Event bus / SQS (lab)" as Queue
folder "Object storage / S3 (lab)" as Storage
Operator --> Shell : HTTPS
Shell --> OIDC : OIDC login
Shell --> API : REST
API --> Tenant
API --> Catalog
API --> Fiscal
API --> Reporting
Fiscal --> DB : transaction + outbox
Tenant --> DB
Catalog --> DB
Reporting --> DB
Fiscal --> Storage : signed artifacts
Fiscal --> Queue : document prepared
Queue --> Connector : delivery intent
Connector --> SII : controlled test / authorized only
Connector --> Queue : delivery result
Queue --> Notify
Queue --> Reporting
note bottom of Fiscal
CAF, folio, signing and fiscal state
must remain under one owner
end note
note bottom of Connector
Never issue folios. Unknown results
require reconciliation before retry.
end note
@enduml
